517 |         :type instance: :class:`cms.models.pluginmodel.CMSPlugin` instance
518 | 
519 |         .. note::
520 |             As of version 4 of django CMS the position counter does not re-start at 1 for the first
521 |             child plugin. The ``position`` field  and ``language`` field are unique for a placeholder.
522 | 
523 |         Example::
